msgstr ""
"Here, the fate of what you find is decided.\n"
"Melt it, socket it, polish it, crack it open, or let it grow — every slot "
"does something suspiciously useful to your items.\n"
"Found objects turn into jewelry, treasures, and strange masterpieces that "
"someone is bound to buy."

